WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.835
-I think sometimes people
forget there are things

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are physically
exerting in shows.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have injured yourself
in past performan--

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.106 line:92%
You got a concussion onstage?

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:06.873 line:92%
-Oh, that's right. I did.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, well, I've injured myself
a lot, actually.

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.177 line:92%
I'm a bit, you know, clumsy.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does the gentleman that
you're carrying

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
out of the pool
know how clumsy you are?

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.385 size:84% position:42%
-Actually, I'm a little
worried about wetness,

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:19.619 line:92%
you know, slippery floors.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.254 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Most people are, yeah.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.088 line:92%
-Especially when you're carrying

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
a young gentleman,
naked, as well.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.960
But, no, so, when I was
doing "Cabaret" ages ago,

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.095 line:92%
I banged my head on a light.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.532 size:88% position:44%
And at the intermission,
I had to go to hospital.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.068
And it was so funny, because
I had been doing my neti pot,

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.737
you know, that thing where
you put liquid up your nose,

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it cleans out
all your tubes?

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
But sort of half an hour
after that,

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
you sometimes get that
surfer's drip.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I was onstage,
being all, like, sexy,

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.949 line:92%
and, all of a sudden, squirt.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:50.850 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Not so sexy.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, I sort of
sexually ambled over

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the side of the stage
to blow my nose.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I thought,
"Oh, I'm late."

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I ran back on.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was a new route,
where I was going.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I banged my head
into this thing.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:04.397 line:92%
And I got more and more woozy.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.166 size:78% position:39%
And I remember, like,
at the intermission,

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've, like, crawled up to
my dressing room,

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:08.601 line:92%
I was lying on the floor,

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
obviously in a state
of, you know, concussion.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:11.471 line:92%
And the stage manager was like,

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:15.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Do you think you can
do the second half, Alan?"

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No! I have to go to
the hospital.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.180
And what was hilarious was --
So, it was a very hot day.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.149
And there was a lady in
the audience had fainted,

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:26.152 size:81% position:41%
you know, with sort of
heat and excitement.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she had been taken
to hospital.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then what was hilarious
was that I was taken

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the same hospital
where she was.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so they said to
me, "There's a lady next --"

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:36.463
And I had these tubes
and the mask, you know, oxygen.

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.797 size:88% position:44% line:92%
My body went into shock.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they came and said,
"There's a lady next door."

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:40.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was a member of
the audience.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.203
And she was so upset 'cause
she had been wanting to see you

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.271
for months and months and
months, and she's so sad

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she missed
the second half of the show.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.775 line:92%
Would you go in and see her?"

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"I can't walk right now."

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.846 line:92%
They said, "We'll wheel you in."

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, like, they said
to her -- They go,

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You remember how you've been
looking forward

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:56.516 size:88% position:44% line:92%
to seeing Alan Cumming?"

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "I know.
I can't believe it."

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:04.357
And they go, "Well, here he is!"
And they wheeled me in.

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:07.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was merciless.
-Yeah.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:10.530 line:92%
-It also -- It seems connected.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.165 size:78% position:39%
It seems like they're
saying to her like,

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:12.999 line:92%
"Remember how excited you were?

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, after you left, he died.
He almost died."

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.206
But, of course, you went
because you are so sweet.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.775 line:92%
You sail -- What do you call --

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
You took a ship
from England here.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A cruise -- You don't cruise.
You don't cruise.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not a cruise.
It's a sailing.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:29.782
You sail the Atlantic, I think.
Yeah.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
I sailed the Atlantic.
-And you brought your mother.

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:35.054 size:78% position:39%
-I took my mom, yeah,
on the Queen Mary 2.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's, like,
a Roaring '20s-type theme

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:37.590 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
on the ship.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, they have these --
It's so fun.

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:41.728
Like, you dress up.
It's like stepping back in time.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:42.996 line:92%
And you dress up for dinner.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:46.499
And one night,
there was the Roaring '20s ball.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then this is --

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And did your mom just have
the time of her life?

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She loved it.
I dressed up as a gangster.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:53.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know.
Isn't that the cutest thing?

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.475
-And this is the second time
you've done this trip with her?

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I did it once
a few years ago with her.

00:02:57.577 --> 00:02:58.711 line:92%
And I was kind of dreading it.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:59.546 line:92%
I sort to thought, "Oh, gosh."

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:01.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, being trapped on
a boat with sort of

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
elderly people would be --
You know.

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:06.886
It was actually great, because,
you know, I'd quite like it,

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
but when you're kind of
well-known,

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
if there's elderly people,
you can just run,

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:12.959 line:92%
and they can't catch you.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:13.426 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's say if, God forbid,
anything happened,

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.698
like, women and children first,
you're basically a child.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:22.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've never felt sort of
like a twink.

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:23.269 line:92%
But do you know what happened?

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:25.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
Someone did get helicoptered
off the boat,

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:26.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they'd fractured
a thing.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:29.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we had to get help before
we left Canadian waters.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:32.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I found out,
from the entertainment lady --

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:34.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I, you know,
did a Q&amp;A on this one --

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they have --
'Cause people regularly die.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause it's like,
you know, 2 1/2 days

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:43.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
and fairly old people
that are weak.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, they have room in
the hospital bit

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:49.495 size:81% position:41% line:92%
for seven dead people.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:50.396 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God!

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:56.035
That -- You -- As adorable as
this photo was, who is gonna --

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to show this again
so people remember

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:03.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
that something nice happens
on this ship of death.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but I think
it's good to know.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
Think if your relative was
on and did die,

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.780 size:78% position:39% line:92%
they have facilities.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is there like
a number at the deli

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:14.320 line:92%
so you know how many empty beds?

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
If it hits 7, you're like,
"Hold on, Grandpa!

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:17.690 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. God.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Just got to make it
to port now."

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:22.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. "Just hang on till
Southampton."

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Always such a pleasure
to see you.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
Happy birthday.
Congrats on the show.

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:29.168 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Alan Cumming, everybody.

